    <coloph>de nas dam pa'i rigs can rnam pa mang mchod pa mchod de// pad+ma ragta ni ma lang/ ka ma la mu ga ta nam/ lo ga ban d+ha ni/ sarba karma su tse me/ chos la chags pa chags pas ste// yum la chags pa chags pa'i mchog/ 'gro ba'i gtso la phyag 'tshal lo// las rnams thams cad rdzogs gyur ste// g.yar dam nyam chags skongs gyur cig/ dpa' bo khyod la phyag 'tshalo// bdag cag lung 'di bzung bar bgyis// zhes brjod pas/ gsang ba'i bdag po chos kyi skur thim/ dam pa'i rigs can rnams kyi rjes su bzung ngo/ /he ru ka'i gal po chen po zhes bya ba/ lung 'di sa cad kyi rgyal po zhes bya ba rdzogs s+ho// // rgya gar gyi pan t.i ta pad+ma sam bha bas/ bal po ba su d+ha ra la gnang/ des gnubs sangs rgyas la gnang ngo</coloph>
